    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Epic Boon Feat (Prerequisite: Level 19+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Saving Throw Reroll.</strong> When you fail a saving throw, you can reroll it, and you must use the new roll. Once you use this benefit, you can't do so again until the start of your next turn.</p>",
